      "MALORIE: Oh my god... Jess...\nJESSICA: You stay in.\nMALORIE: Let go, Jess, let go--",
      "MALORIE: What is wrong with you?!\nJESSICA: GET BACK IN GET BACK IN GET--"
    ]
